  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math><mi>M</mi></math> be a square matrix of order <math><mn>3</mn></math> whose elements are real numbers and&nbsp;<br />\r<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>j</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>j</mi><mi>M</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mn>36</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>6</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mn>6</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math>, then the absolute value of <math><mi>T</mi><mi>r</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is<br />\r[Here,&nbsp;<math><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>j</mi><mi></mi><mi>P</mi></math> denotes adjoint matrix of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi></math> and <math><msub><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> denotes trace of matrix <math><mi>P</mi></math>&nbsp;i.e. sum of all principal diagonal elements of matrix <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi></math>]"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "8",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<math><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>j</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>j</mi><mi></mi><mi>M</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mi>M</mi></math><br /><math><mo>&#8756;</mo></math> order of <math><mi>M</mi></math> is <math><mn>3</mn></math><br /><math><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>j</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>j</mi><mi></mi><mi>M</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>M</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mn>36</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>6</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>6</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>6</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mfenced></math><br />Taking determinant on both the sides&nbsp;<math><msup><mrow><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mn>36</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>6</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>6</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><msup><mrow><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo></math> <math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>&#177;</mo><mn>6</mn></math><br />hence,&nbsp;<math><mi>M</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mo>&#177;</mo><mn>6</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>&#177;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>&#177;</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>&#177;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mtd><mtd><mo>&#177;</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>r</mi></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mi>M</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn></math>"
